DESCRIPTION:Smarter Skies\, More Resilient Systems: The Future of Commerci
 al Aviation\nThe National Academy of Engineering Regional Event at Duke U
 niversity will convene leading experts from industry\, government\, and a
 cademia to explore next-generation challenges and solutions in aviation\,
  including:\n\nClimate and weather-related considerations\nInnovation and
  emerging technologies\nAir traffic control and operational advancements\
 n\nRegistration is required
