CREATED:20260317T141010Z
DESCRIPTION:Join the ORBIT (Observational Research Building Interdisciplin
 ary Therapeutic Advances) Interdisciplinary Hub for the upcoming seminar\
 , "Propensity Score Weighting for Causal Subgroup Analysis\," on May 21 a
 t 1 p.m. Laine Thomas\, PhD\, will lead this interactive event open to al
 l members of the Duke community.\n\nDr. Thomas will discuss causal infere
 nce methods for subgroup analysis in observational studies\, including pr
 opensity score weighting estimators\, overlap weighting\, and visualizati
 on tools for assessing covariate balance across subgroups. The seminar dr
 aws on findings from research applying these methods to the COMPARE-UF re
 gistry to evaluate treatment options for uterine fibroids.
DURATION:PT1H
DTSTAMP:20260317T141132Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260521T130000
LAST-MODIFIED:20260317T141132Z
