DESCRIPTION:At the conclusion of this activity\, learners should be able t
 o:\n\n\n* Understand how the field of medicine\, in particular Dermatolog
 y and Dermatopathology\, was changed during the Third Reich\n\n\n* Review
  the role physicians played during the Nazi regime\n\n\n* Reflect on what
  it means to be a physician
